{"id":"en_midnight-allure","title":"Midnight Allure","titleEn":"Midnight Allure","description":"Emma Woods suffers from night blindness and is bound to an Allure System that requires her to absorb male energy in order to raise her luck points. One night in a bar, she mistakes Liam Miller, a domineering CEO, for a bar host, and the two end up spending the night together. Emma never realizes that Liam is in fact the new CEO of her company. Convinced she is deliberately staging a secret office romance, Liam goes along with what he takes to be her act, until he learns that her night blindness is the reason she truly does not recognize him. Further complications come from Emma's meddling ex-boyfriend and Liam's manipulative childhood friend. When Emma finds herself in danger, Liam intervenes to protect her, and their bond deepens—only for the pair to discover unexpectedly that their paren","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/midnight-allure/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/midnight-allure/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Urban","Soulmate","One Night Stand","CEO/Billionaire","SecretIdentity"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dce7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_midnight-allure_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dce7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_midnight-allure_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dce7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_midnight-allure_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dce7c/?pub=4occa